; The records of the TLD `test` on the lab's authority node (round `recursion` of smoke.sh,
; README.md). The SOA and the apex NS set (a.root.test.) come from the zone's creation
; through the API; this file is imported into the zone with POST .../records/import.
$ORIGIN test.
$TTL 3600
example              NS a.root.test.
; The root server's own address, authoritative here.
a.root               A  203.0.113.10
; The real name server of the delegation with out-of-bailiwick glue (oob.quirk).
ns.elsewhere         A  203.0.113.18
